    "Add a field to Category.",
    "Add one or more measures to Values.",
    "Optionally add a Series to split the chart.",
    "Use the toolbar to switch between bars, stacked, line and area."
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "What if I have thousands of categories?",
      "a": "Bars and stacked bars show the top categories and group the rest as Other. Change Top categories in Settings (0 shows all)."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I plot several measures?",
      "a": "Yes. Add them all to Values; they become series when no Series field is set."
    },
    {
      "q": "Does clicking filter other visuals?",
      "a": "Yes. Click a bar or point; Ctrl-click to add more."
    }
  ],
